  <ym-title|Evidence: common short-range covariance on every
  period><label|evidence-common-short-range-covariance-on-every-period>

  Status: draft; bounded local source/math review requested. This unit proves
  the period-folding, common inverse, cut, and telescope implications at the
  stated inputs. It does not produce the paid row-width/gap schedule or the
  <verbatim|Paying> budget.

  <section|Source pin and files read><label|source-pin-and-files-read>

  Imported Lean source revision: <verbatim|3456e5e75cf8d4cd558955a5c7638fba2d68f464>
  (the source pin recorded by the repository manifest for this task).

  Inspected source files:

